Subject: [PATCH 9/9] =?UTF-8?q?expert=5Fpack:=20approx=5Fdraft=5Fexperts?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E2=80=94=20approximate=20expert=20fetching=20for=20speculat?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ive=20draft=20rows=20/=20MTP=20draft=20layer?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Rows at draft positions of a verify batch (and the NextN draft layer) may use only
VRAM- or VRAM+RAM-resident experts; dropped experts get zero gate weight, the rest
are renormalised. Lossy for the committed bonus token (see report §18); off by default.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
